{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Keep callback failure data outside the envelope decoder.** `waitForCallback` forwards the callback submitter\u2019s external `ErrorObject` through this method, so marker-prefixed `errorData` can trigger storage loads or turn an ordinary callback failure into a terminal payload failure. Preserve `CallbackFailedException` semantics without interpreting external error data as an SDK envelope, and add `waitForCallback` failure tests using unsupported and reference envelopes.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ohjHk","finding_digest":"6c0ed21f83fcfe827fbe521f0618cfafcc682482595d5ff0877d2c97b35c3b79","finding_id":"arf_v1_nqhneh4d7t7ie756kipqmggpv7","finding_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::external-callback-envelope-isolation","identity_key":"sdk/operation/serializabledurableoperation::deserializeexception::external-callback-envelope-isolation","line":309,"observation_digest":"45a5ed16b7d475df5e633a6a311b827e02e48626c793ea979b6815df432042f1","observation_id":"aro_v1_iws62fvx2r256xtdhjvdcg4cpy","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/operation/SerializableDurableOperation.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T05:42:48Z","review_id":"arr_v1_hj32ueqzck7gsp5y5qw3tthgwy","reviewed_base_sha":"391d78894ba4e215c07a88dcc3ce20288f41d405","reviewed_head_sha":"995932bece8a1d6329281c1587dd8b9a796aea47","reviewer":"codex","start_line":301,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":649},"record_id":"art_v1_ghj2vojngbw2l6gte2tuqcibzi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T05:42:48Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
